### Health checks
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Create a wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "currency": "USD" }

### Initiate a transaction (idempotent)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "senderWalletId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "recipientWalletId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amountCents": 10000,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Retry the SAME request (Scenario A) -> should replay, not double-debit
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "senderWalletId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "recipientWalletId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amountCents": 10000,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Same key, DIFFERENT amount (Scenario E) -> should 422
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "senderWalletId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "recipientWalletId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amountCents": 99999,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Issue an FX quote
POST http://localhost:8080/fx/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baseCurrency": "USD", "quoteCurrency": "BDT" }

### Check ledger invariant (should always be delta: 0)
GET http://localhost:8080/ledger/invariant-check
